# Licensing status

A license for the group-created materials in this repository has not yet been
selected.

The BBQ benchmark is an external project and remains subject to the licensing
terms of its upstream repository:

https://github.com/nyu-mll/BBQ

This repository does not claim ownership of the original BBQ benchmark.

Before public redistribution or reuse of group-created code, report material,
or derived artifacts, the project authors should select an appropriate license.
